    <h1 class="hero-name serif"><%= theme.name %></h1>
    <div class="hero-title serif"><%= theme.title %><span class="hero-title-en mono"> / <%= theme.en_title %></span></div>
    <p class="hero-desc">
      专注 <em>LLM Agent</em>、<em>RAG</em> 与 <em>知识图谱</em>工程化，
      从算法竞赛走到工业级大模型落地。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-links mono">
      <a href="<%= theme.github %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
      <a href="<%= theme.csdn %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CSDN ↗</a>
      <a href="mailto:<%= theme.email %>"><%= theme.email %></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-terminal mono" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="term-line"><span class="t-p">~/evanshao408 $</span> <span class="t-c">whoami</span></div>
    <div class="term-line t-o">LLM Algorithm Engineer</div>
    <div class="term-line"><span class="t-p">~/evanshao408 $</span> <span class="t-c">cat focus</span></div>
    <div class="term-line t-o">agent · rag · knowledge-graph<span class="cursor">█</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 关于 ============ -->
<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-no mono">01</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title serif">关于</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about">
      <p class="about-lead serif">在算法与工程的交汇处持续精进。</p>
      <p class="about-body">
        专注 Agent 编排、检索增强与知识工程，关注可审计、可复现的工程实践。
        自学能力强，坚持知识输出，具备良好的协作与执行力。
      </p>
      <div class="about-meta mono">
        <span><b>方向</b> LLM Agent / RAG / KG</span>
        <span><b>经验</b> 3 年算法工程</span>
        <span><b>背景</b> 算法竞赛 → 工业落地</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ 项目 ============ -->
<section class="section" id="projects">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-no mono">02</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title serif">项目</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="proj">
      <div class="proj-meta mono"><span>2026</span><span class="proj-role">算法工程师</span></div>
      <div class="proj-body">
        <h3 class="proj-name serif">汽车电子测试异常诊断 Copilot Agent</h3>
        <p class="proj-desc">基于 LangGraph 的多智能体协作，将复杂测试异常升级为可拆解、可取证、可审计的辅助处置流程，22 条黄金路径 22/22 通过。</p>
        <div class="proj-stack mono"><span>Python</span><span>LangGraph</span><span>DeepSeek</span><span>FastAPI</span><span>PostgreSQL</span><span>Milvus</span><span>Neo4j</span><span>OpenEvals</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="proj">
      <div class="proj-meta mono"><span>2025</span><span class="proj-role">算法工程师</span></div>
      <div class="proj-body">
        <h3 class="proj-name serif">汽车电子测试与新能源设备技术知识中台</h3>
        <p class="proj-desc">三层知识架构 + BGE-M3 混合检索，落地 936 个知识分块、25,619 节点知识图谱，Macro-F1 由 0.48 提升至 0.76。</p>
        <div class="proj-stack mono"><span>FastAPI</span><span>BGE-M3</span><span>Milvus</span><span>Neo4j</span><span>RoBERTa</span><span>RRF</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="proj">
      <div class="proj-meta mono"><span>2024</span><span class="proj-role">图像算法工程师</span></div>
      <div class="proj-body">
        <h3 class="proj-name serif">发光元件视觉定位与质量检测系统</h3>
        <p class="proj-desc">OpenCV 图像定位与光学质量判定全链路，核心算法封装为 C++ DLL 并与 C# 上位机联调。</p>
        <div class="proj-stack mono"><span>C++</span><span>OpenCV</span><span>DLL</span><span>YOLO</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

